<title>USA: Taiwan's TFMA seeks 68,300 tonnes U.S. wheat-trade.</title>
<headline>Taiwan's TFMA seeks 68,300 tonnes U.S. wheat-trade.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Taiwan Flour Millers Association (TFMA) is tendering Tuesday for 68,300 tonnes of U.S. wheat, U.S. exporters said.</p>
<p>The tender included 34,000 tonnes for April 25-May 15 shipment (17,300 tonnes spring wheat, 11,600 tonnes hard red winter wheat and 5,100 tonnes white wheat) and 34,300 tonnes for May 15-June 5 shipment (18,300 tonnes spring wheat, 11,500 tonnes hard red winter and 4,500 tonnes white wheat).</p>
<p>((Nigel Hunt 312-408 8720))</p>
